{"product_id":"snap-zbuds","title":"Snap Zbuds","description":"\u003ch3 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"20\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"18\"\u003eSnap Zbuds\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"22\" data-end=\"306\"\u003eThe Snap Zbuds are engineered for music lovers and multitaskers who want powerful sound, effortless controls, and all-day comfort. With immersive audio, long-lasting battery, and seamless connectivity, Snap Zbuds are your go-to earbuds for work, workouts, and everything in between.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"311\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"313\" data-end=\"346\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"344\"\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"454\"\u003e🎧 \u003cstrong data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"383\"\u003eCompact \u0026amp; Lightweight Design\u003c\/strong\u003e – Ergonomic earbuds with a sleek charging case for easy portability.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"560\"\u003e🔊 \u003cstrong data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"478\"\u003eImmersive Audio\u003c\/strong\u003e – 12 mm dynamic drivers with SBC and AAC decoding deliver rich, balanced sound.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"681\"\u003e🔋 \u003cstrong data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"590\"\u003eExtended Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e – Up to \u003cstrong data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"610\"\u003e7 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e of playtime on a single charge and \u003cstrong data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"664\"\u003e29 hours total\u003c\/strong\u003e with the case.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"778\"\u003e⚡ \u003cstrong data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"716\"\u003eQuick Charging \u0026amp; USB‑C Port\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fully charges in \u003cstrong data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"747\"\u003e2 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e for uninterrupted listening.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"891\"\u003e🔗 \u003cstrong data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"808\"\u003eSeamless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Bluetooth 5.3 with 10 m range, quick auto‑pairing, and master‑slave switching.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"1023\"\u003e🎙 \u003cstrong data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"920\"\u003eClear Calls Anywhere\u003c\/strong\u003e – Dual MEMS microphones with ENC (Environmental Noise Cancellation) for crystal‑clear conversations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1148\"\u003e🖐 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1064\"\u003eTouch Controls \u0026amp; Voice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e – Play\/pause, switch tracks, and activate Siri\/Google Assistant with simple taps.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1224\"\u003e💧 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1179\"\u003eIPX4 Splash Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Built to withstand sweat and light rain.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1229\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1266\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1264\"\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1986\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1319\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1319\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1292\"\u003eEarbud Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 27.39 × 25.01 × 23.02 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1371\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1371\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1351\"\u003eCharging Case Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 66 × 43.7 × 32 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1395\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1395\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1385\"\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 30.42 g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1455\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1455\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1419\"\u003eBattery Capacity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 50 mAh (earbuds) + 480 mAh (case)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1516\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1516\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1471\"\u003ePlaytime:\u003c\/strong\u003e 7 hours (single charge) \/ 29 hours (total)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1547\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1547\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1536\"\u003eStandby Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 70 hours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1588\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1588\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1568\"\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2 hours via USB‑C\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1632\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1632\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1613\"\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.3 (10 m range)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1659\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1659\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1647\"\u003eChipset:\u003c\/strong\u003e Jieli7016\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1702\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1702\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1679\"\u003eAudio Driver:\u003c\/strong\u003e 12 mm dynamic driver\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1745\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1745\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1728\"\u003eFrequency Response:\u003c\/strong\u003e 20 Hz – 20 kHz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1769\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1769\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1762\"\u003eImpedance:\u003c\/strong\u003e 16 Ω\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1803\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1803\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1788\"\u003eSensitivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 112.5 ± 3 dB\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1838\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1838\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1827\"\u003eDecoding Support:\u003c\/strong\u003e SBC, AAC\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1873\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1873\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1857\"\u003eMicrophones:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dual MEMS Mic\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1940\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1940\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1899\"\u003eNoise Cancellation:\u003c\/strong\u003e ENC (Environmental Noise Cancellation)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"1986\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1986\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1964\"\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IPX4 (splash‑proof)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"1991\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2025\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2023\"\u003eWhy Choose Snap Zbuds?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2409\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003eSnap Zbuds are more than just wireless earbuds—they’re your all‑day companion for calls, music, and workouts. With powerful audio, reliable ENC for clear calls, and a compact design, they’re built for every moment. Whether you’re commuting, hitting the gym, or just unwinding, Snap Zbuds keep you connected and entertained without compromise.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Lavender Haze","offer_id":50335110660374,"sku":"23427","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Cool Grey","offer_id":50335110627606,"sku":"23425","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Pearl White","offer_id":50335110693142,"sku":"23426","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Lavendar-Haze_2.webp?v=1771238203","url":"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/products\/snap-zbuds","provider":"ZeroLifestyle.co","version":"1.0","type":"link"}